{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2021-10-06 16:15:00', 'title': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS SEPTEMBER SALES RESULTS', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., OCT. 06, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY REPORTED NET SALES OF $19.50 BILLION FOR THE RETAIL MONTH OF SEPTEMBER, THE FIVE WEEKS ENDED OCTOBER 3, 2021, AN INCREASE OF 15.8 PERCENT FROM $16.84 BILLION LAST YEAR.'}